1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,273
Your agents need tools to finish their work.

2
00:00:02,672 --> 00:00:04,839
Give the team a shared budget without giving every

3
00:00:04,864 --> 00:00:07,677
agent unrestricted access to company funds.

4
00:00:07,872 --> 00:00:11,403
Here, research-scout paid one cent in no-value test tokens

5
00:00:11,428 --> 00:00:13,010
for an account access check.

6
00:00:13,485 --> 00:00:15,414
Open the report to see the useful result.

7
00:00:15,608 --> 00:00:17,728
Four keys could fully control this account.

8
00:00:18,088 --> 00:00:19,593
Confirm who holds each one.

9
00:00:19,953 --> 00:00:23,074
This report was reconstructed from the saved delivery block;

10
00:00:23,395 --> 00:00:25,151
the original response wasn’t preserved.

11
00:00:25,345 --> 00:00:27,368
Refresh current data without paying again,

12
00:00:27,613 --> 00:00:28,715
then download the report.

13
00:00:29,171 --> 00:00:30,561
This is a live public read,

14
00:00:30,786 --> 00:00:32,388
separate from the recorded purchase.

15
00:00:32,582 --> 00:00:34,028
In a separate recorded run,

16
00:00:34,158 --> 00:00:37,471
another agent’s request hit the shared workspace cap.

17
00:00:37,735 --> 00:00:40,267
The owner gets useful work while the budget stops

18
00:00:40,292 --> 00:00:41,182
further spending.

19
00:00:41,377 --> 00:00:44,716
The supporting twenty-request test settled fifteen payments

20
00:00:44,741 --> 00:00:45,842
and blocked five.

21
00:00:46,318 --> 00:00:48,285
NEAR enforces one shared limit,

22
00:00:48,529 --> 00:00:50,323
using pay-only agent keys.

23
00:00:50,518 --> 00:00:53,299
Orbit is a testnet prototype for teams buying services

24
00:00:53,324 --> 00:00:54,156
with NEAR.

25
00:00:54,689 --> 00:00:55,791
Today, review the work,

26
00:00:55,901 --> 00:00:57,579
its cost, and the budget protection.

27
00:00:58,112 --> 00:01:00,079
Real merchant adoption is still needed.
